# The lab is 78 GB of weights, renders and clones. What belongs in git is what we WROTE:
# code, notes and results. Everything else is reproducible or someone else's.

# Nothing by default; text we authored is added back below.
*

# ...but always descend into directories, or the un-ignore rules below never match.
!*/

!*.py
!*.md
!*.sh
!*.txt
!*.toml
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.cfg
!.gitignore

# Someone else's repo, vendored for a spike.
worldclaw/
penny-fork/
scene-gen/Word2World/
rig-lab/SkinTokens/
rig-lab/UniRig/
rig-lab/AniGen/
rig-lab/Anytop/
rig-lab/kimodo/
img2threed/TripoSplat/
img2threed/img2threejs/

# Ours, but not source.
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/logs/
**/out/
**/outputs/
**/viz/
**/renders/
img2threed/lato2/

# Weights live on ext4 at /var/lib/models/rig; these are symlinks to them, and the text files
# that used to sit under them are the model's own, not ours.
rig-lab/hf_cache
rig-lab/i2v/turbo
rig-lab/AniGen/ckpts
rig-lab/SkinTokens/experiments
img2threed/lato2/ckpt
